# MATLAB generated figures are regenerable by running the scripts — keep the repo lean.
# The .mat DATA records under code/matlab_outputs/**/data/ ARE tracked (reproducibility record).
# Curated previews for the README live under assets/previews/ (tracked).
code/matlab_outputs/**/panels/*.png
code/matlab_outputs/**/panels/*.pdf
code/matlab_outputs/**/previews/*.png
code/matlab_outputs/**/previews/*.pdf

# Temporary files
*.asv
*.m~
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
.venv/
*.log

# Internal build/patch scaffolding — kept locally, excluded from the public release.
# These document the internal patching process and are not part of the published artifact.
original_scripts/
diffs/
PATCH_REPORT.md
static_check_output.txt

# Generated integrity manifest — stale once scaffolding is excluded.
# Regenerate locally with: python tools/static_check_repo.py
manifest_sha256.txt
